The '''Snowman Pet''' is a {{skill|combat}} [[Pet]].

== Obtaining ==
The {{Legendary}} '''Snowman Pet''' can be obtained by opening {{Item|Red Gift}}s from the [[Season of Jerry]] event. There is a {{Chance|0.05%|1|1938.24|gifts}} chance of receiving a Snowman Pet from the Red Gifts.

A '''Snowman Pet''' can be upgraded to {{Mythic}} rarity by giving {{NPCSprite|Kat}} a {{Item|Magic Top Hat}} and {{c|1m}}.

