== Trivia ==
*The '''Snowman Pet'''{{'}}s {{AN|Snow Cannon}} ability can hit mobs up to {{Green|8}} blocks away. It is affected {{Stat|Ferocity}} and is affected by the damage bonus of {{AN|One For All}}.
*The '''Snowman Pet'''{{'}}s {{AN|Snow Cannon}} ability is able to damage {{MobSprite|Liquid Hot Magma}}s and the [[Defend Jerry's Workshop|Magma Cubes]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. If the [[Defend Jerry's Workshop#Power-Ups|Strongarm]] power-up is active, the snowball it fires deals double damage as well.
*{{Common}} Snowman Pets were once obtainable, but no longer are. One of the last remaining ones can be found on {{RN|admin|TimeDeo}}'s island.

